CORE
Main
--function Main.pi --cp `../../../../scripts/format_classpath.sh . ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/core-models.jar ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/cprover-api.jar`
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^string refinement: upper-case conversion is only modelled for characters below U\+0100 that convert within that range, so a counterexample may be spurious$
--
--
"π".toUpperCase() is "Π" in Java, so the assertion fails. The conversion of
characters from U+0100 is not modelled, which used to leave them unchanged
and prove the assertion.
